Hi [~accountid:61cc1c8e90cfd20071b2fd31]\! Welcome to the team 🎉  I have refactored charger auth endpoints by moving them to {{rental-fleet-auth}} service. You can check the transporter app as it uses {{rental-fleet-auth}} service.  Here are the changes:

{{rentalFleet/authenticate}} → {{charger/authenticate}}
{{rentalFleet/getAccessToken}} → {{charger/getAccessToken}}
{{rentalFleet/logout}} → {{charger/logout}}
{{rentalFleet/profile}} → {{charger/profile}}
{{rentalFleet/appOpened}} → {{charger/appOpened}}

In addition, charger and transporter apps send app version in wrong format. 

Note: I have not deployed the changes to the live. I will inform you once it is ready.

Notes about data tables:

{{ext_pricing.price_prediction_result_rate}}

* *prediction stage*
* contains unique (price_prediction_token, search_category_id) pairs with predicted prices for individual drivers
* {{predicted_price}} is the price shown on the UI screen chosen from {{driver_prices}}
** It could be median, Bolt price or max price depending on {{is_model}} enabled & number of drivers. From targeting we receive parameter {{top_n_drivers}}  (default 3), and we take top n drivers based on conversion rates and choose max price of this drivers.
* one-to-many mapping with {{ext_pricing.driver_pricing_select_drivers}} ({{price_prediction_token}} -> {{order_id}} through {{public.etl_search_denormalized_view}})

{{ext_pricing.driver_pricing_select_drivers}}

* *matching stage* ({{order_id}} is created with specific {{search_category_id}})
* contains {{driver_prices}} of suitable drivers within chosen {{search_category_id}}

